SUMMARY OF CHANGES & RESOLVED ISSUES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. UNIVERSAL CATEGORY PROFILE ENGINE FOR TRUSTSHEET AI ASSISTANT (`getProductCategoryProfile`)
   - Fixed issue where non-hardware products (e.g. perfumes, skincare, apparel, groceries) displayed hardcoded hardware chips ("Does it heat up during summer?", "What is the real battery backup?", "Is a fast charger included in the box?") and "Hardware Truth Assistant" title.
   - Introduced dynamic category resolver mapping titles and categories:
     * Fragrance / Perfume: "Fragrance & Scent Truth Assistant" + projection, longevity, drydown notes, skin sensitivity doubts, and tailored placeholder.
     * Beauty & Skincare: "Beauty & Skincare Truth Assistant" + acne safety, active ingredients, residue, layering doubts.
     * Fashion & Footwear: "Style & Fit Truth Assistant" + true-to-size fit, fabric breathability, shrinkage/color bleeding.
     * Food & Grocery: "Food & Quality Truth Assistant" + shelf-life, storage requirements, preservatives, allergens.
     * Supplements: "Supplement & Nutrition Truth Assistant" + lab certification, digestive tolerance, purity.
     * Software & SaaS: "Software & SaaS Truth Assistant" + subscription tiers, cancellation, export limits.
     * Tech & Hardware: "Hardware Truth Assistant" (battery endurance, thermal throttling, charging, warranty).
     * General Products: "Product Truth Assistant" (return reasons, trade-offs, durability).
   - Dynamically adapted Verdict Card ("Fragrance Specialist’s Bottom-Line Verdict"), Aging Timeline ("Fragrance Maceration & Shelf-Life Timeline"), and Spec Benchmarks to eliminate inappropriate "Hardware" labels on consumer goods.

2. ACTIVE VERIFIED COUPONS & PROMOS RESPONSIVE UI POLISH
   - Fixed mobile display bug where coupon code, discount text, and copy button were forced into a single horizontal flex row, squeezing long discount copy ("Extra 10% off (max ₹150) on ₹599+ cart") into a narrow 80-100px column that wrapped every word onto separate lines.
   - Re-architected coupon card layout:
     * Top Row: Prominent dashed-border monospace coupon code badge (`AI_START_BEAUTY`) with "Active" badge on the left, and distinct 1-click "Copy" button on the right with responsive feedback ("Copied").
     * Bottom Row: Full card width bold emerald discount headline with zero line truncation or awkward squishing, accompanied by minimum order terms.

